$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=rectinttay  LOC_AFTER=?

* The Taylor expansion with remainder of a holomorphic function on a rectangle: 2 pi i times the value at a strictly interior point Z is the first N Taylor terms about a strictly interior centre P plus the remainder integral of order N.

